# Rare Candy (decomp party menu PartyMenuCB_LevelUp): Piplup L15 takes a Rare Candy: "elevated to
# Lv. 16", the stats window (the increases, then the values), no move at 16, then the level-up evolution
# check (decomp LEVELUP_STATE_CHECK_EVOLUTION) evolves it into Prinplup, which wants Metal Claw but knows four
# moves: the waits answer NO, then give up (`evolve auto`). Back in the bag, the candy is gone.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_PIPLUP 15
give item platinum:ITEM_RARE_CANDY 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_201 115 853 right
until idle
+0 evolve auto
+1 press x
+1 release x
until app start-menu
+1 tap entry:1
+1 assert app bag
+1 tap pocket:1
+1 tap row:0
+1 tap menu:0
+1 assert app party
+1 tap slot:0
+1 assert state party[0].level 16
+0 assert state party[0].exp 2535
+0 assert state bag.medicine []
+0 screenshot rare-candy
+1 press a
+1 release a
+1 press a
+1 release a
+1 press a
+1 release a
+1 assert app evolution
until app bag 3000
+0 assert state party[0].species "platinum:SPECIES_PRINPLUP"
+0 assert state party[0].moves ["platinum:MOVE_GROWL","platinum:MOVE_BUBBLE","platinum:MOVE_WATER_SPORT","platinum:MOVE_PECK"]
+1 tap cancel
until app start-menu
+1 press b
+1 release b
until idle
+0 reload
until idle
